<title>USA: Profit Recovery Group Q4 shr $0.12.</title>
<headline>Profit Recovery Group Q4 shr $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				   Three Months Ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Revs			     $  21,788   $  16,061</p>
<p> Oper income			  3,296	 1,808</p>
<p> Income taxes (1)		   1,336	   ---</p>
<p> Net				    2,087	 1,267</p>
<p>Pro forma information:</p>
<p>Historical earnings</p>
<p>   before income taxes	    3,423	 1,267</p>
<p> Pro forma income taxes (2)     1,336	   495</p>
<p> Pro forma net earnings	   2,087	   772</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>    share (3)			  0.12	  0.06</p>
<p>Avg common/common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>    outstanding		    18,137	14,948</p>
<p>					  Year ended Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revs				 $77,330    $ 56,031</p>
<p> Oper income			 11,039	 6,442</p>
<p> Income taxes (1)		   7,789	   305</p>
<p> Net				    3,150	 4,507</p>
<p>Pro forma information:</p>
<p>Historical earnings</p>
<p>   before income taxes	   10,939	 4,812</p>
<p> Pro forma income taxes (2)     4,271	 1,877</p>
<p> Pro forma net earnings	   6,668	 2,935</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>    share (3)			  0.39	  0.21</p>
